# TC-004: Freeze concentration and recovery of a lower-salt melt
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100g @ 5C
add v1 NaCl 1g
measure v1 conductivity
cool v1 10kJ
measure v1 thermometer
inspect v1
new
filter v1 v2
inspect
heat v1 10kJ
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
inspect
